'' RUN: 'function = this' copies the receiver into a by-value UDT result, over plain fields and
'' over a type with constructors -- the store was dropped (TKO0994). Expected output is
'' fbc-modern 1.20's, byte for byte.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/funcresult-this.tiko -o tests/codegen/funcresultthis.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/codegen/funcresultthis.exe
'' RUN: tests/codegen/funcresultthis.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  3 4 7
